# Filipino Agent

A tool-calling assistant for Filipino, English, and Taglish, with a hand-built agent loop, an evaluation harness, and synthetic data, QLoRA/MLX fine-tuning, and a SwiftUI client.

## Quick start
```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
cp .env.example .env          # add your ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
pytest                        # runs offline, no API key needed
python -m agent.cli           # chat in the terminal
python -m eval.run_eval       # score the gold cases
uvicorn api.main:app --reload # API on http://localhost:8000
```

## Layout
| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `agent/` | Model client, loop, tools, prompts |
| `shared/tool_schemas.json` | Single source of truth for tools (Python and Swift) |
| `eval/` | Gold cases, metrics, runner, saved results |
| `api/` | FastAPI service |
| `ios/` | Xcode project and `SwiftStarter/` files |
| `data/`, `training/` | Synthetic data pipeline and fine-tuning (Phases 2-3) |
| `docs/` | Architecture and international considerations |

